  "description": "A fluent style for building KiCadSharp documents. Every Add* on the document types has a\nWith* extension here that returns the parent, so calls chain, and hands the child it created to an\noptional callback, so chaining never costs access to it. KiCadSharp's own Add* API is unchanged: this\nis one more way to build the same documents, not a replacement.",
